This distribution is bert-score 0.3.13 with these changes:
- bert_score/utils.py: when a tokenizer declares no maximum length (transformers' sentinel
  model_max_length of int(1e30)), encode without truncation instead of passing the sentinel
  as max_length, which made fast tokenizers raise OverflowError.
- Packaging: pyproject.toml replaces setup.py; distribution name fitzyracing-bert-score;
  import names bert_score and bert_score_cli unchanged.
- Tests: tests/test_fork_fixes.py; README, CHANGELOG and this NOTICE.
